OL,3,GNEWSADrugs, cash and weapons found in
OL,4,Araids as e-bikes 'blight' communities
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmphetamine, cannabis, suspected
OL,7,Fcocaine, cash and weapons have been
OL,8,Ffound in early morning raids across
OL,9,Fsouth Wales as part of a clampdown on
OL,10,Fe-bikes.
OL,12,FPolice are growing increasingly
OL,13,Fconcerned about the link between
OL,14,Fe-bikes, serious organised crime and
OL,15,Fchild exploitation - with many
OL,16,Fsuspected offences being committed by
OL,17,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
