OL,3,GNEWSADrugs, cash and weapons found in
OL,4,Araids as e-bikes 'blight' communities
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne senior officer said people were
OL,7,F"fed up" of e-bikes "blighting" areas
OL,8,Facross the UK, while an expert said
OL,9,Fthey could "grease the wheels" of
OL,10,Forganised crime.
OL,12,FThe BBC has been given access to an
OL,13,Foperation by South Wales Police to
OL,14,Fcombat e-bike related crime, from
OL,15,Fillegal riding, to drug dealing - a
OL,16,Flocal response to a national problem.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
